---
import type { SiteInfoContent } from "../../../../shared/types";

interface Props {
  site: SiteInfoContent;
}

const { site } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-20 px-4 md:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <div class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-text-body">
      <p>
        Walk through our doors on any given morning and you'll hear the sizzle of eggs on
        the griddle, the friendly shout of "order up!", and the kind of easy conversation
        that only happens in a place where everybody's a regular. That's {site.name} —
        a Holly, Michigan staple since 1995.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6">
        We're part of a proud tradition of Michigan coney islands — those no-nonsense
        diners where the chili is homemade, the coffee is always fresh, and you never leave
        hungry. Our coney dogs are smothered in our own chili sauce recipe, topped with
        diced onions and a perfect line of yellow mustard. Pair that with a side of crispy
        hash browns and a bottomless cup of coffee, and you've got the kind of meal that
        keeps families driving in from Fenton, Clarkston, and all over Oakland County.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6">
        But {site.name} is more than just great food. It's the booth where you celebrated
        your kid's first Little League win. It's the counter seat where you catch up with
        neighbors you haven't seen all week. It's the place where the staff remembers your
        name, your usual order, and asks about your family. Holly is a tight-knit town,
        and we're proud to be part of what makes it feel like home.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Restaurant photo placeholder -->
    <div class="mt-10 aspect-[16/9] bg-brand-accent rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-2 border-brand-primary/10">
      <svg
        class="w-16 h-16 text-brand-primary/20"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="m2.25 15.75 5.159-5.159a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3.182 0l5.159 5.159m-1.5-1.5 1.409-1.409a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3.182 0l2.909 2.909M3.75 21h16.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 22.5 18.75V5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 20.25 3H3.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 1.5 5.25v13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3.75 21z"
        />
      </svg>
      <p class="text-brand-primary/40 text-sm mt-3 font-medium">
        Restaurant photo coming soon
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
